WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.960
Big Bargain Sale

00:02.150 --> 00:03.940
Choyaku Fighter Yoritsuna!

00:06.240 --> 00:12.150
Lobster Monster Issei VS Justice Ranger Yoritsuna

00:06.690 --> 00:09.260
There you are, Lobster Monster Issei!

00:09.260 --> 00:12.150
I will protect the peace of the Earth!

00:12.500 --> 00:14.730
Ogura Kick!

00:15.710 --> 00:17.330
You got me!

00:17.940 --> 00:19.700
Justice has triumphed!

00:20.000 --> 00:21.280
Hello, everyone.

00:21.280 --> 00:22.700
I'm Teika.

00:22.700 --> 00:24.590
I'm Utsunomiya Yoritsuna.

00:24.590 --> 00:26.620
This is the Ise Grand
Shrine, in Mie prefecture.

00:26.620 --> 00:28.810
This shrine once housed
a High Priestess,

00:28.810 --> 00:30.580
who was selected from the unmarried

00:30.580 --> 00:32.830
young women of the Imperial Family.

00:32.830 --> 00:33.630
Oh...

00:34.580 --> 00:36.540
Once the High Priestess'
service was complete,

00:36.540 --> 00:38.590
her options were to
remain single for the

00:38.590 --> 00:41.060
rest of her life or join
the Emperor's harem.

00:41.580 --> 00:45.020
It was extremely rare for
one to wed a retainer.

02:17.080 --> 02:19.810
When my grandfather, head of the

02:19.810 --> 02:22.370
Naka no Kanpaku family, was still alive,

02:22.370 --> 02:25.330
the entire family
gathered in the palace.

02:25.960 --> 02:29.750
My grandfather put me in
his lap and told jokes.

02:30.260 --> 02:35.260
He looked so happy as everyone
chatted about nothing.

02:36.270 --> 02:38.790
There was a lady-in-waiting
watching from behind the curtain...

02:39.480 --> 02:42.010
What was her name?

02:42.010 --> 02:44.320
Yes, it was Sei Shonagon.

02:44.860 --> 02:46.270
My aunt was very fond of her.

02:47.810 --> 02:50.640
At one point, Emperor Ichijo came over,

02:50.640 --> 02:54.860
and the celebration
became a grand affair.

02:55.330 --> 02:59.070
My grandfather, grandmother,
father, and siblings

02:59.070 --> 03:01.910
were all joyous on that day.

03:02.360 --> 03:05.840
A memory of long lost glory...

03:05.840 --> 03:07.140
Excuse me.

03:08.890 --> 03:11.410
I need to close shop.

03:12.250 --> 03:15.250
Michimasa and Masako

03:12.250 --> 03:15.250
Minister of Left Kyoto Michimasa

03:17.810 --> 03:20.140
That was a pointless dream.

03:20.140 --> 03:23.000
Tomorrow, I'm supposed to
escort the High Priestess.

03:23.000 --> 03:24.310
I need to go home.

03:24.310 --> 03:25.800
You there!

03:26.980 --> 03:29.250
Stop this!  He looks danger—

03:29.250 --> 03:31.020
You look strong!

03:31.020 --> 03:33.400
I order you to be my bodyguard tonight!

03:33.400 --> 03:34.310
Come with me!

03:34.590 --> 03:35.730
Huh?

03:35.730 --> 03:37.730
That will not do, Your
Highness!  Let us return!

03:37.730 --> 03:39.320
I refuse!

03:39.320 --> 03:42.210
Who knows when I'll get another chance?

03:42.210 --> 03:43.270
Your Highness?

03:43.270 --> 03:45.860
Are you Princess Masako?

03:45.860 --> 03:46.780
That's right!

03:48.470 --> 03:51.050
Hurry!  I snuck out!

03:51.050 --> 03:52.670
I'll be in trouble if they find me!

03:52.670 --> 03:53.940
Please wait!

03:53.940 --> 03:55.500
The High Priestess should
not be outside at night...

03:55.500 --> 03:57.120
What's wrong with you?!

03:57.120 --> 03:59.920
You look like a villain, but
you're scared of being punished?

04:00.490 --> 04:01.670
Villain...

04:02.110 --> 04:03.340
Please!

04:03.810 --> 04:07.160
I may never return to the capital!

04:07.160 --> 04:08.860
I want to see the place where

04:08.860 --> 04:10.470
I was born with my own eyes.

04:15.410 --> 04:18.320
If you drop Her Highness,
you'll pay dearly!

04:18.770 --> 04:20.370
Shut your mouth.

04:20.370 --> 04:22.150
You can carry her if you want.

04:23.200 --> 04:25.500
Okay, we're here.

04:25.500 --> 04:27.320
This spot offers a good
view of the palace.

04:29.400 --> 04:31.970
On the right, you have the Emperor's
residence, the Seiryoden.

04:31.970 --> 04:34.290
Just to the left of center,
there's the Senyoden,

04:34.830 --> 04:36.480
where your mother lives.

04:39.040 --> 04:42.610
I don't want to go to Ise.

04:43.320 --> 04:45.890
I don't want to leave the capital.

04:45.890 --> 04:47.830
I don't want to leave my father!

04:47.830 --> 04:50.810
It's so tragic, Your Highness!

04:51.320 --> 04:52.480
Worry not!

04:52.480 --> 04:55.690
Menoto no Chujo Naishi will
follow you everywhere!

04:56.200 --> 04:58.320
What am I supposed to do?!

04:58.320 --> 04:59.370
Uh...

04:59.370 --> 05:00.610
F-For now...

05:00.610 --> 05:02.730
Hug

05:03.010 --> 05:05.240
What do you think you're doing?!

05:05.740 --> 05:08.500
I thought it would be
appropriate to cry with you.

05:08.500 --> 05:09.290
Silence!

05:09.290 --> 05:11.740
How could you understand
Her Highness' suffering?!

05:12.400 --> 05:14.270
Th-That's true...

05:14.700 --> 05:16.040
Th-Then...

05:16.280 --> 05:18.080
H-Here you are.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.670
Flowers.  Flowers from the capital.

05:21.670 --> 05:23.000
And some grass.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.350
Take all you want.

05:24.350 --> 05:25.940
And some dried meat.

05:25.940 --> 05:27.200
From the capital.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.150
For you to eat.

05:28.150 --> 05:29.480
Er, please try some.

05:29.480 --> 05:30.700
What else is there...

05:30.700 --> 05:31.490
Dirt!

05:31.490 --> 05:32.590
Dirt from the capital!

05:36.090 --> 05:39.480
Thank you.  You're a much
nicer person than you look.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.670
I love you.

05:42.380 --> 05:44.440
I-It's an honor...

05:45.310 --> 05:47.670
What's your name?

05:47.670 --> 05:49.550
Fujiwara no Michimasa.

05:49.550 --> 05:50.460
Michimasa...

05:50.460 --> 05:51.500
You're Michimasa?

05:51.500 --> 05:52.830
I won't forget you.

05:54.510 --> 05:56.250
Say, Michimasa...

05:56.980 --> 05:59.000
When I return to the capital,

05:59.000 --> 06:03.210
will you carry me up here again?

06:03.910 --> 06:07.240
Yes, if that is your wish,

06:07.240 --> 06:09.640
I would be happy to join you.

06:10.980 --> 06:13.730
I'm so happy!  It's a promise!

06:18.980 --> 06:20.990
Three years later,
Her Highness' father,

06:20.990 --> 06:23.500
the Emperor, retired.

06:24.420 --> 06:26.710
I was assigned to the
Chamberlain's office

06:26.710 --> 06:28.990
when the new Emperor took over,

06:28.990 --> 06:31.480
but I was dismissed a few days later.

06:32.390 --> 06:35.570
The glory the Naka no Kanpaku family once held

06:35.570 --> 06:37.900
is now held against us.

06:37.900 --> 06:38.750
Look!

06:41.620 --> 06:45.520
There was a procession for
Her Highness' return to the capital.

06:47.210 --> 06:49.550
I wrote a letter to the princess,

06:50.330 --> 06:52.930
to welcome her back to the capital.

06:53.860 --> 06:56.890
Nothing more than that.

06:57.350 --> 07:00.420
I never expected her to send a reply.

07:09.180 --> 07:11.660
It's been such a long time, Michimasa.

07:12.220 --> 07:13.620
Thank you for coming.

07:14.370 --> 07:15.300
I would like to...

07:16.810 --> 07:19.790
I've been longing to see you!

07:20.170 --> 07:22.000
I-I am honored...

07:23.160 --> 07:28.700
I never thought that the princess
and I would fall in love.

07:33.290 --> 07:35.640
Thank you for coming, Michimasa.

07:36.030 --> 07:39.430
Tonight, we must discuss our elopement.

07:40.470 --> 07:42.190
I refuse.

07:42.500 --> 07:44.570
Have you changed your mind?!

07:44.570 --> 07:45.910
Didn't you...

07:45.910 --> 07:50.320
...promise to take me away?!

07:50.760 --> 07:53.780
I didn't mean that we should elope.

07:55.020 --> 07:56.370
Honestly...

07:56.370 --> 07:58.710
Think about it.

07:58.710 --> 08:01.830
A princess can never marry a retainer.

08:03.520 --> 08:06.650
But if we elope and
find a place to hide,

08:06.650 --> 08:09.110
they'll have to accept it!

08:10.320 --> 08:14.610
Besides, this is for your own good.

08:14.610 --> 08:15.550
Huh?

08:16.270 --> 08:20.030
This may sound conceited,
but my father,

08:20.030 --> 08:23.020
the Former Emperor Sanjo,
loves me very much.

08:23.470 --> 08:28.320
Yes, you're the apple
of his eye, right?

08:28.320 --> 08:30.400
We can take advantage of that!

08:31.270 --> 08:34.410
As it is, if my father finds out
about our relationship,

08:34.410 --> 08:37.160
he will be furious with you.

08:37.630 --> 08:39.830
But if we get married,
that will change.

08:41.210 --> 08:44.650
My father will ensure that
his beloved daughter's husband

08:44.650 --> 08:46.570
is given an appropriate rank.

08:47.350 --> 08:49.210
I don't want that!

08:49.210 --> 08:50.980
Hmm?  Why not?

08:50.980 --> 08:55.930
That would make it look like I
was using you for my own gain.

08:57.830 --> 08:59.720
Please, Michimasa!

08:59.720 --> 09:01.020
Don't worry.

09:01.020 --> 09:02.430
I would never question your love!

09:02.430 --> 09:05.770
I'm worried about what
<i>other</i> people will think!

09:07.470 --> 09:10.770
We cannot do anything that would

09:10.770 --> 09:13.860
disgrace the Naka no Kanpaku family!

09:15.490 --> 09:18.520
But...  In that case...

09:19.810 --> 09:24.310
How can we be together?

09:25.160 --> 09:29.340
P-Please be patient and wait.

09:30.420 --> 09:32.550
I will climb up the ladder!

09:32.550 --> 09:36.260
I will become worthy enough
to seek your hand!

09:36.730 --> 09:38.090
I promise!

09:44.770 --> 09:45.680
Yes...

09:49.390 --> 09:50.810
I'm sorry!

09:50.810 --> 09:53.080
I was too impatient.

09:53.080 --> 09:54.160
Your Highness...

09:54.160 --> 09:56.320
I'll be supporting you, Michimasa.

09:56.820 --> 09:59.500
Please take me away.

10:02.720 --> 10:06.210
So how am I supposed to advance?

10:06.700 --> 10:09.570
Since my father was
ruined by Michinaga,

10:09.570 --> 10:11.450
my family has fallen.

10:12.560 --> 10:15.070
Perhaps I should try to
take Michinaga down...

10:15.830 --> 10:19.330
No, I will never manipulate people

10:19.330 --> 10:22.100
or ruin their lives the way he did.

10:23.700 --> 10:26.760
I'll have to work hard and
do this the long way.

10:27.300 --> 10:28.620
Michimasa-dono!

10:29.490 --> 10:30.500
Chujo...

10:32.240 --> 10:35.400
The Former Emperor Sanjo knows of you!

10:38.130 --> 10:40.550
He is absolutely furious!

10:40.550 --> 10:42.730
He is ignoring our pleas

10:42.730 --> 10:45.880
and he has confined Her Highness!

10:45.880 --> 10:49.630
I have been expelled from the
palace for being an accomplice.

10:49.630 --> 10:52.720
I fear that there is no hope...

10:58.670 --> 11:02.890
How can we be together?

11:06.430 --> 11:08.530
She knew...

11:09.310 --> 11:13.310
The two of us could never
legitimately be together.

11:15.540 --> 11:17.430
I should have taken her away,

11:17.430 --> 11:19.770
instead of letting my
pride get in the way.

11:19.770 --> 11:21.910
I should have taken her with me...

11:23.290 --> 11:26.160
But it's too late now.

11:31.720 --> 11:34.580
If I affix a letter to this tree,

11:34.580 --> 11:38.460
someone may notice and
deliver it for me.

11:39.630 --> 11:44.430
After I determined to abandon my love,

11:44.430 --> 11:47.640
my only regret is that I have
no way to tell you in person.

11:49.550 --> 11:51.260
Now that we can never meet again,

11:51.980 --> 11:57.810
I only wish that I could tell
you in person to give up.

12:15.130 --> 12:16.290
Masako.

12:17.320 --> 12:18.380
Father.

12:18.920 --> 12:21.550
Mind if I gaze at the moon with you?

12:22.600 --> 12:23.280
Okay.

12:27.850 --> 12:30.140
How do you find the moon tonight?

12:31.950 --> 12:36.110
It shines brightly, as there
are no clouds to hide it.

12:36.110 --> 12:37.620
Indeed.

12:38.630 --> 12:42.260
My vision is blurry these days,
so I can't see very well,

12:42.260 --> 12:44.040
but I can see that there is light.

12:44.630 --> 12:47.490
Because it's hazy,
it looks even bigger.

12:48.060 --> 12:51.320
It still makes for a beautiful sight.

12:53.370 --> 12:58.200
I also feel that the moon
appears bigger tonight.

12:59.200 --> 13:00.960
Perhaps it's because of my tears.

13:02.170 --> 13:07.310
Masako, you must hate me.

13:08.100 --> 13:11.480
However, I didn't have a choice.

13:11.480 --> 13:15.360
I couldn't allow a princess
who was also High Priestess

13:15.360 --> 13:17.840
to wed a low-ranking member

13:17.840 --> 13:21.110
of the Naka no Kanpaku
family with no future.

13:21.640 --> 13:24.040
Even if that was what you wanted...

13:24.040 --> 13:27.490
Please don't speak of that, Father.

13:28.590 --> 13:31.520
I didn't understand back then.

13:33.510 --> 13:38.560
My grandfather and grandmother
looked so happy that day.

13:40.530 --> 13:44.220
Oh, I was talking about the past again.

13:44.720 --> 13:46.270
That was a depressing story.

13:46.810 --> 13:48.680
I apologize, Masako-sama.

13:48.680 --> 13:50.420
No, it's fine.

13:50.880 --> 13:53.280
I like it when you have a serious look

13:53.280 --> 13:54.640
on that scary face of yours.

13:55.110 --> 13:57.000
You have poor taste.

13:57.000 --> 13:58.640
That's not true.

13:58.640 --> 14:03.130
When I hear your sad
stories, I feel motivated.

14:03.130 --> 14:04.380
Motivated...

14:05.390 --> 14:07.510
To not end up that way, right?

14:07.510 --> 14:09.080
Not exactly.

14:09.810 --> 14:11.620
In any case, I feel motivated.

14:15.300 --> 14:17.370
I always thought that

14:17.370 --> 14:20.170
I would be the one to bring light

14:20.170 --> 14:21.880
into Michimasa's dark life,

14:22.690 --> 14:24.250
and that Michimasa

14:24.980 --> 14:29.220
was the only man who
could make me happy.

14:29.930 --> 14:33.000
I was still innocent then.

14:33.680 --> 14:36.680
Midnight Moon

14:33.680 --> 14:36.680
The Former Emperor Sanjo

14:37.670 --> 14:41.980
It was the night before I would leave

14:41.980 --> 14:44.160
the capital to serve as High Priestess

14:44.160 --> 14:46.700
after my father was named Emperor Sanjo.

14:47.480 --> 14:49.870
Masako-sama!  This will not do!

14:49.870 --> 14:51.930
If something were to happen in the dark,

14:51.930 --> 14:55.040
I wouldn't be able to keep you safe!

14:55.550 --> 14:57.540
You worry too much!

14:57.540 --> 14:59.940
I'll find a bodyguard then!

15:04.390 --> 15:05.880
You there!

15:07.980 --> 15:10.670
Stop this!  He looks danger—

15:10.670 --> 15:12.340
You look strong!

15:12.340 --> 15:14.670
I order you to be my bodyguard tonight!

15:14.670 --> 15:15.600
Come with me!

15:20.030 --> 15:22.970
If you drop Her Highness,
you'll pay dearly!

15:22.970 --> 15:24.520
Shut your mouth.

15:24.520 --> 15:26.230
You can carry her if you want.

15:27.320 --> 15:29.590
Okay, we're here.

15:29.590 --> 15:31.410
This spot offers a good
view of the palace.

15:32.960 --> 15:35.970
On the right, you have the Emperor's
residence, the Seiryoden.

15:35.970 --> 15:38.370
Just to the left of center,
there's the Senyoden,

15:38.770 --> 15:40.490
where your mother lives.

15:43.140 --> 15:46.450
I don't want to go to Ise.

15:47.450 --> 15:49.270
I don't want to leave the capital.

15:49.810 --> 15:52.340
I don't want to leave my father!

15:55.990 --> 15:57.500
H-Here you are.

15:59.330 --> 16:00.880
Flowers.  Flowers from the capital.

16:00.880 --> 16:02.220
And some grass.

16:02.220 --> 16:03.560
Take all you want.

16:03.560 --> 16:05.180
And some dried meat.

16:05.180 --> 16:06.340
From the capital.

16:05.180 --> 16:08.720
That was when I knew...

16:06.340 --> 16:07.260
For you to eat.

16:07.260 --> 16:08.800
Er, please try some.

16:08.800 --> 16:09.840
What else is there...

16:09.840 --> 16:10.780
Dirt!

16:10.780 --> 16:12.270
Dirt from the capital!

16:15.080 --> 16:18.540
Thank you.  You're a much
nicer person than you look.

16:19.550 --> 16:20.920
I love you.

16:19.670 --> 16:23.500
I was destined to be with him.

16:21.560 --> 16:23.500
I-It's an honor...

16:24.250 --> 16:26.680
What's your name?

16:26.680 --> 16:28.570
Fujiwara no Michimasa.

16:28.570 --> 16:29.590
Michimasa...

16:29.590 --> 16:30.690
You're Michimasa?

16:30.690 --> 16:32.070
I won't forget you.

16:33.180 --> 16:35.040
Say, Michimasa...

16:35.760 --> 16:37.810
When I return to the capital,

16:37.810 --> 16:41.980
will you carry me up here again?

16:42.820 --> 16:46.190
Yes, if that is your wish,

16:46.190 --> 16:48.480
I would be happy to join you.

16:50.600 --> 16:53.390
As the daughter of the
Emperor, I had no freedom.

16:53.950 --> 16:56.160
Life in the palace was dull.

16:56.960 --> 17:01.910
Michimasa was the one who saved me.

17:02.820 --> 17:08.890
Like a hero out of a storybook
who swooped in to rescue me.

17:13.800 --> 17:18.710
Even while I was High Priestess,
I never forgot about him even for a day.

17:19.850 --> 17:21.310
And after three years,

17:22.630 --> 17:25.840
my term ended when my father retired,

17:25.840 --> 17:27.400
so I left Ise.

17:28.460 --> 17:30.400
As soon as I returned to the capital,

17:30.400 --> 17:32.320
I received a letter from Michimasa.

17:33.250 --> 17:35.200
"He remembered me!"

17:35.760 --> 17:38.460
"I'm destined to be with him!"

17:40.150 --> 17:43.430
My wish would finally be granted.

17:44.060 --> 17:45.210
But...

17:46.460 --> 17:50.120
Michimasa wasn't willing
to take me away.

17:53.430 --> 17:56.840
It was all my fault.

17:57.430 --> 17:59.630
I acted like a fool and never thought

17:59.630 --> 18:02.280
about the position you were in, Father.

18:06.320 --> 18:09.230
Yes, I was a fool...

18:10.110 --> 18:12.230
I didn't realize that Father

18:12.230 --> 18:15.030
and Michimasa had to
worry about reputation.

18:16.220 --> 18:19.890
I only tried to impose my own
childish dream upon them...

18:21.590 --> 18:23.620
We can take advantage of that!

18:24.320 --> 18:27.480
As it is, if my father finds out
about our relationship,

18:27.480 --> 18:30.210
he will be furious with you.

18:30.660 --> 18:32.960
But if we get married,
that will change.

18:34.120 --> 18:37.720
My father will ensure that his
beloved daughter's husband

18:37.720 --> 18:39.460
is given an appropriate rank.

18:40.460 --> 18:42.390
I don't want that!

18:42.390 --> 18:44.020
Hmm?  Why not?

18:44.020 --> 18:45.850
That would make it look like

18:45.850 --> 18:49.060
I was using you for my own gain.

18:50.730 --> 18:52.680
Please, Michimasa!

18:52.680 --> 18:55.530
Don't worry.  I would
never question your love!

18:55.530 --> 18:58.860
I'm worried about what
other<i> people will think!</i>

18:59.210 --> 18:59.920
Huh?

18:59.920 --> 19:01.950
We cannot do anything that would

19:01.950 --> 19:06.350
disgrace the Naka no Kanpaku family!

19:02.400 --> 19:03.380
What do you mean?

19:04.930 --> 19:06.780
Your family's reputation

19:06.780 --> 19:08.960
is more important than our love?

19:10.490 --> 19:13.770
But...  In that case...

19:15.130 --> 19:19.430
How can we be together?

19:20.280 --> 19:24.450
P-Please be patient and wait.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.370
I will climb up the ladder!

19:27.860 --> 19:31.230
I will become worthy enough
to seek your hand!

19:31.600 --> 19:33.330
What is he talking about?

19:34.020 --> 19:41.290
No one will allow a retainer to
wed a former High Priestess.

19:42.670 --> 19:47.040
You should know that our
only choice is to elope.

19:48.150 --> 19:49.880
Why is he...

19:49.880 --> 19:51.140
Why...

19:55.560 --> 19:59.040
Why was I born the
daughter of an Emperor?

19:59.740 --> 20:04.390
Our difference in status is
too difficult to overcome.

20:05.800 --> 20:09.150
We can never be together,

20:09.620 --> 20:11.850
even though I love him so much.

20:16.100 --> 20:21.000
It wasn't my father's fault that
our love didn't come to be.

20:21.830 --> 20:24.910
Once Michimasa refused to elope,

20:25.390 --> 20:27.790
we had no chance...

20:28.800 --> 20:29.900
Masako...

20:30.490 --> 20:32.860
I intend to become a monk.

20:33.790 --> 20:36.600
A miserable human being such as myself

20:36.600 --> 20:41.040
can do no good in my current position.

20:41.040 --> 20:45.800
I couldn't even support my
daughter in her love.

20:46.240 --> 20:48.830
I will follow Buddha
and attempt to atone

20:48.830 --> 20:51.310
for the wrongs I have done.

20:51.920 --> 20:57.200
However, even then, if my life drags on,

20:57.200 --> 20:59.400
I will continue to remember...

21:01.010 --> 21:05.370
As the years pass,
I will find myself longing

21:05.370 --> 21:08.310
for the sight of a midnight moon.

21:09.680 --> 21:14.710
If I live on, despite
having no will to live,

21:14.710 --> 21:19.600
I will surely long to see once more
the lovely moon we saw this night.

21:21.630 --> 21:27.010
That was the poem of despair that my
father composed when he retired.

21:28.510 --> 21:30.960
I should cut my hair and become a nun.

21:32.390 --> 21:34.700
My dream could only
happen in a storybook.

21:34.700 --> 21:37.310
There is no one to take
me away from this place.

21:38.830 --> 21:43.250
Even if there is, it
wouldn't be Michimasa.

21:45.390 --> 21:47.060
In that case,

21:47.060 --> 21:49.580
I should lock our love
inside and become a nun.

21:51.150 --> 21:54.610
But if my life drags on too long,

21:55.250 --> 21:59.080
I will follow my father's
example and remember...

22:00.310 --> 22:02.800
The moon we saw on the night we met.

22:04.220 --> 22:07.010
The moon that shone on the
night we were reunited.

22:08.400 --> 22:11.620
The moon that watched
alone over our trysts.

22:12.830 --> 22:18.640
A eternal light to
illuminate our love.

22:21.580 --> 22:23.640
Michimasa!  Michimasa!

22:24.200 --> 22:28.400
If we meet in another life,

22:29.580 --> 22:31.780
please take me away.

22:32.910 --> 22:34.950
Poetic Tale 12:

22:32.910 --> 22:34.950
END

24:04.960 --> 24:20.800
Next
Episode

24:04.960 --> 24:20.800
Teika and Noriko

24:04.960 --> 24:20.800
Princess Shokushi
Gon Chunagon Teika

24:07.150 --> 24:12.750
As I wait for someone
who will never come,

24:12.750 --> 24:16.820
my body burns like the seaweed
drying on the shores of Matsuho.
